# Data Dictionary

## Overview

This document defines the variables contained in the initial community energy infrastructure dataset.

Each variable is classified as supplied, inferred, calculated or awaiting collection.

## 1. Existing Dataset Variables

| Variable | Description | Unit | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| Community Label | Original community identification label | Text | Supplied |
| Community Name | Standardized community name | Text | Inferred |
| Design Round | Design month and year extracted from label | Date | Inferred |
| Average Daily Load | Average daily electrical load figure | Wh | Supplied; unit basis unconfirmed |
| Total PV Capacity | Total solar photovoltaic capacity | kWp | Supplied |
| MPPT Capacity | Maximum power point tracking capacity | kW | Supplied |
| Battery Capacity | Total battery storage capacity | kWh | Supplied |
| Inverter Capacity | Total inverter power capacity | kW | Supplied |

## 2. Calculated Variables

| Variable | Calculation | Unit |
|---|---|---|
| Battery per kWp PV | Battery Capacity / PV Capacity | kWh/kWp |
| Inverter per kWp PV | Inverter Capacity / PV Capacity | kW/kWp |
| MPPT per kWp PV | MPPT Capacity / PV Capacity | kW/kWp |

